  "notes": "USAGE: {洞察|どうさつ} implies seeing beyond the surface to understand underlying truths. Often used with {力|りょく} to form ⟦{洞察力|どうさつりょく}→洞察力：08523_dousatsuryoku⟧ (insight, perceptiveness).\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦{洞察力|どうさつりょく}→洞察力：08523_dousatsuryoku⟧ (insight, perceptiveness)\n- ⟦{鋭|するど}い→鋭い：02347_surudoi⟧{洞察|どうさつ} (keen/sharp insight)\n- ⟦{深|ふか}い→深い：01211_fukai⟧{洞察|どうさつ} (deep insight)\n- {洞察|どうさつ}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{得|え}る→得る：02014_eru⟧ (to gain insight)\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{観察|かんさつ}→観察：02558_kansatsu⟧ (observation - more external, empirical)\n- ⟦{察知|さっち}→察知：21208_sacchi⟧ (perception - detecting/sensing)\n- ⟦{見抜|みぬ}く→見抜く：06975_minuku⟧ (to see through - verb form)",
